                                                "text": "2007 [publication date], Maggie Bullock, \"Home Improvement\", Elle, January 2008 ed., page 108,\nHuber was a physicist. Even top Estée Lauder chemists who took over for Huber in 1995 found that... any attempt to cheat on his original formula produced disappointing results, which demands the question: If they couldn't DIY, can you?"
